cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use STELLA in your research, please cite this repository."
title: "STELLA: Solar Temporal Event Learning & Likelihood Assessment"
abstract: >-
  Solar-flare early-warning system fusing Aditya-L1 SoLEXS (soft X-ray)
  and HEL1OS (hard X-ray) telemetry via the Neupert effect to forecast
  flare probability and infrastructure impact 30-60 minutes ahead.
